{"gb2_m|Ey up. Where d'you want us?":["3x6tct.mp3",2.19],"gb2_m|Right then, where are we settin' up?":["bkrxw6.mp3",1.5],"gb2_m|Big lass is ready, boss.":["ymiklt.mp3",1.45],"c_reyes|The Legion fell back across the Kessel River and dug in on the east bank.":["1yu356u.mp3",3.92],"c_reyes|There is a high bridge between the central bluffs. Whoever holds the east bluff controls the crossing.":["1mqom3b.mp3",5.15],"c_hale|The bridge deck is the fast way across. The road bridges north and south are slower, but they'll be watching the deck.":["zgxc1n.mp3",6.62],"c_hale|Rhinos rolling across the north bridge!":["1j6mfzc.mp3",2.5],"c_reyes|The bluff is ours. Artillery on that deck and push for the factory.":["1mm8ram.mp3",3.95],"c_draganov|You cross my river, Colonel? Then you will swim back.":["1ro83aq.mp3",3.14],"c_hale|Factory's burning, ma'am. The east bank is ours.":["278mw2.mp3",3.14],"c_reyes|Good. Keep the bridge — we will need it.":["ovnxam.mp3",2.57],"c_reyes|The river holds them — for now. Try again, Commander.":["1em7k90.mp3",3.61],"c_reyes|The Divide. Primary objectives.":["1yr8ke3.mp3",2.37],"c_reyes|First: Secure the east bluff at the high bridge.":["101lzg6.mp3",2.67],"c_reyes|The Legion is using an EMP tower on the north mesa to blind our satellites over the Highlands.":["7bvxwo.mp3",5.24],"c_reyes|Take it. With that tower we see everything they do.":["wk1gbs.mp3",3.26],"c_hale|Two Legion bases up north. The highway runs under the overpass — watch the deck above your head.":["13b459c.mp3",5.77],"c_hale|Ramps up to the mesa are on the west and east ends. Bring an Engineer.":["dcln78.mp3",4.34],"c_draganov|You climb, Vanguard, but hills do not stop artillery.":["11rvtae.mp3",3.13],"c_reyes|Tower is ours. Their bases just lit up on every screen we have.":["v6w44x.mp3",3.86],"c_hale|Deck secured. Anything crossing the valley goes under our guns now.":["18z3jp6.mp3",4.07],"c_reyes|The Highlands are ours. Draganov is running out of places to hide.":["zpi5g0.mp3",3.99],"c_reyes|We lost the high ground. Pull back and try again.":["4nbdt1.mp3",3.02],"c_reyes|High Ground. Primary objectives.":["3yyieo.mp3",2.48],"c_reyes|Three Mobile HQs are waiting on the west bank of Port Merrow. We need them on the east bluff to open a second front.":["11w6kzi.mp3",6.46],"c_hale|The only way across for something that size is the high bridge between the bluffs. Legion guns cover the far end.":["dqbeo1.mp3",7.1],"c_reyes|The convoy moves in ninety seconds. Clear the deck — at least two must make it.":["18iobxk.mp3",4.57],"c_hale|Convoy is staged by the west bluff ramp. Get some armour up on that deck.":["4xy9cf.mp3",4.56],"c_hale|Thirty seconds to move out.":["uywvbo.mp3",1.51],"c_reyes|Convoy is rolling. Keep them alive.":["11cra4q.mp3",2.55],"c_draganov|Such big, slow targets. My gunners thank you.":["npm2pa.mp3",3.26],"c_reyes|They made it. Now hold that bluff until they are dug in.":["1eeyb83.mp3",3.33],"c_hale|Bluff's locked down. We have a foothold on the east bank.":["83woph.mp3",3.38],"c_reyes|A second front. Draganov will have to split his army now.":["6l3ke3.mp3",3.65],"c_reyes|The convoy is lost. We cannot open the east bank without it.":["1p8rqdu.mp3",3.91],"c_reyes|Convoy. Primary objectives.":["1ynwpdh.mp3",2.31],"c_reyes|Escort at least 2 Mobile HQs to the east bluff.":["1j93hnd.mp3",3.04],"c_reyes|The Legion is growing Syndicate tissue in a lab behind the Firing Line. If that research works, they will breed a hive of their own.":["1tngmxc.mp3",6.86],"c_ghost|One of me, a lot of them. Just how I like it.":["ex16yh.mp3",2.79],"c_ghost|On the ground. Lovely night for it.":["1tve6ky.mp3",2.26],"c_ghost|Crossing the high bridge. They never look up.":["1c0b594.mp3",2.75],"c_hale|Relay's live — EMP away! Their guns are dark. Move, Ghost!":["1dm43tp.mp3",4.28],"c_ghost|Tech Centre's gone. Colonel — they had Syndicate tissue on ice in there. Grown from our DNA.":["92gf73.mp3",6.08],"c_draganov|An intruder in my base? Sound the alarm! Find her!":["yzpgl3.mp3",3.64],"c_reyes|Get out of there, Ghost. And not a word about those samples to anyone.":["1832qw8.mp3",4.07],"c_reyes|Ghost is down. Abort, abort.":["g8mdrm.mp3",2.56],"c_reyes|Ghost Protocol. Primary objectives.":["1ftnapg.mp3",2.59],"c_reyes|First: Reach the relay on the north bluff.":["18sjbr4.mp3",2.46],"c_reyes|Then: Destroy the Power Plant.":["1wvr3dj.mp3",1.93],"c_reyes|And finally: Stay undetected.":["1j38p5t.mp3",2.07],"c_reyes|You are on your own out there. Stay out of sight.":["4y37y3.mp3",2.9],"c_reyes|The research data Ghost recovered is in our Tech Centre on the Iron Ring. Draganov will do anything to destroy it.":["yqgeee.mp3",6.31],"c_hale|Two Legion armies converging, ma'am. Brutal-grade. They'll hit us from every ramp.":["itl0ei.mp3",5.07],"c_reyes|Twelve minutes until the analysis is done and the data is out. Hold.":["aytqu3.mp3",4.54],"c_hale|Defences are up. Put more on the ramps — they come in through the crater.":["5gip90.mp3",3.72],"c_draganov|Twelve minutes, Colonel? Your ring will not last six.":["164urk8.mp3",3.28],"c_reyes|Three minutes. Hold together.":["1vnnn8f.mp3",2.11],"c_hale|Reinforcements inbound from the north!":["18kwnjl.mp3",2.26],"c_reyes|Transmission complete.":["76j77c.mp3",1.4],"c_reyes|Commander... the Legion was not doing this on their own. Someone was giving them orders.":["89kw3y.mp3",4.34],"c_reyes|The data is gone. Everything Ghost risked — gone.":["1kvjpgs.mp3",3.23],"c_reyes|Hold the Line. Primary objectives.":["1p6okxx.mp3",2.42],"c_reyes|First: Survive until the data is transmitted.":["24p9zv.mp3",2.76],"c_reyes|Then: Protect the Tech Centre.":["12ty0nt.mp3",1.93],"c_reyes|Draganov's last stronghold is across the Broken Lakes. End it.":["144zzj8.mp3",4.27],"c_hale|Ma'am, the analysts flagged strange transmissions from the south-east. Not Legion codes.":["97fw0k.mp3",5.73],"c_reyes|Noted. Deal with the Legion first.":["11rhlsu.mp3",2.54],"c_hale|Bridges on both channels. The plateau to the north overlooks the centre.":["1pnennl.mp3",4.2],"c_hale|Ma'am... Legion units are firing on each other. Something is in their heads.":["1fb8o6e.mp3",4.02],"c_voice|Vanguard. Legion. So much noise over such small things.":["1tjcd7h.mp3",5.1],"c_voice|I have been listening to you both since the night you pulled me from the ice.":["12lnyly.mp3",4.69],"c_reyes|Starfall's ghost. So that is who has been pulling Draganov's strings. Find that beacon and burn it.":["17ckod6.mp3",6],"c_draganov|Colonel... we were fools. They were in our heads the whole time.":["1dbkwjt.mp3",3.31],"c_reyes|Then help me end it, Marshal.":["p6aurz.mp3",1.65],"c_voice|You broke one voice. There are many more.":["l81lmz.mp3",3.04],"c_reyes|Then we will find every one of them.":["zekvfd.mp3",1.92],"c_reyes|We are pulling back. Whatever is out there, we are not ready.":["1w8urzn.mp3",3.37],"c_reyes|The Hive Below. Primary objectives.":["1hymxqx.mp3",2.58],"c_reyes|This is it. The Syndicate has taken the Grand Crossing and what is left of the Legion's hardliners have joined them.":["1y01n7o.mp3",6.01],"c_hale|My battlegroup is in the south-west. We hit them together.":["n9v044.mp3",3.35],"c_reyes|No half measures, Commander. Wipe the slate clean.":["fs47mo.mp3",3.05],"c_hale|Hill forts on each corner, overpasses linking them. Take the forts and the river is ours.":["z82bbh.mp3",5.31],"c_voice|You think you are liberating this land? You made us, Colonel. We are only finishing your experiment.":["zscxp.mp3",6.66],"c_draganov|Reyes. For what it is worth — I am sorry. Finish them.":["1w7n842.mp3",3.67],"c_reyes|It is over. The Frontier is free.":["6bgbx2.mp3",2.48],"c_hale|For now, ma'am.":["15r8h49.mp3",0.97],"c_reyes|For now is all anyone ever gets, Lieutenant.":["11s56mh.mp3",2.62],"c_reyes|We have lost the Crossing. The Frontier belongs to them.":["1ohqqtn.mp3",3.21],"c_reyes|Clean Slate. Primary objectives.":["1cyl639.mp3",2.43],"c_reyes|Destroy every enemy base.":["1bn0nqh.mp3",1.82],"c_draganov|Iron Dawn. Primary objectives.":["3p30qn.mp3",2.49],"c_bogdan|The old rail yard towns in the basin still have working freight depots. Worth more than the ore.":["hbas76.mp3",5.86],"c_volkova|The Vanguard have a garrison in the south-east. Their Barracks trains the militia that guards the towns.":["10e5er8.mp3",5.67],"c_draganov|Take both towns. Burn the Barracks. Quickly.":["x929vn.mp3",3.41],"c_bogdan|Towns are east and west on the ring road. Conscripts can garrison them.":["yp5f6f.mp3",4.3],"c_bogdan|Depots are ours. Freight credits coming through.":["1h9zocb.mp3",2.99],"c_hale|Legion in the basin. Hit their ring road.":["atp9lz.mp3",2.53],"c_volkova|Efficient. The Marshal has noticed you.":["hdece.mp3",2.53],"c_draganov|The basin is lost. Unacceptable.":["1mhhn9g.mp3",2.59],"c_bogdan|Rail Yard. Primary objectives.":["1m24yla.mp3",2.34],"c_bogdan|First: Hold 2 town buildings.":["1cg5go2.mp3",1.89],"c_bogdan|Then: Destroy the Vanguard Barracks.":["x24qw7.mp3",2.07],"c_draganov|The Vanguard hold the Iron Ring. Its crater is the richest ground on the Frontier.":["tvvrwa.mp3",4.83],"c_volkova|Take the crater floor. Then break their fortress in the north-east.":["6i1u9.mp3",3.85],"c_bogdan|Two overpasses cross the crater. Hold one and you can shoot down on anything that moves.":["pk9uf1.mp3",5.29],"c_volkova|Ramps into the crater on every side. Choose.":["1nsmkwm.mp3",3.41],"c_reyes|The Ring is ours, Legion. Come and take it — if you can.":["9kdago.mp3",3.69],"c_draganov|The crater is ours. Now crush them.":["1ikwl1h.mp3",2.5],"c_draganov|The Ring is Legion again.":["ha878i.mp3",1.61],"c_draganov|And yet... I dream of voices, Commissar. Every night.":["7ht387.mp3",3.26],"c_volkova|The Ring holds. For now.":["12sn869.mp3",1.89],"c_draganov|Siege of the Ring. Primary objectives.":["1n17022.mp3",2.76],"c_draganov|First: Hold the crater floor for 90 seconds.":["131iezr.mp3",2.84],"c_volkova|The Vanguard are rebuilding in the Dustbowl. No time for a base — you have a strike group.":["1n96xf1.mp3",4.99],"c_volkova|Use the mesas. Bombards on high ground outrange their towers.":["8ebts7.mp3",4.16],"c_bogdan|Found a few more tanks down the back of the depot. Sending them.":["1ws8m21.mp3",3.37],"c_hale|Legion raiders in the Dustbowl!":["osjpi2.mp3",1.77],"c_volkova|Their refinery burns. Good.":["95w0ru.mp3",2.62],"c_volkova|Nothing left standing. The Marshal will be pleased.":["m7tza7.mp3",2.92],"c_volkova|The strike group is gone. Wasteful.":["1asg215.mp3",2.45],"c_volkova|Scorched Earth. Primary objectives.":["1dnifay.mp3",2.53],"c_volkova|First: Destroy the Vanguard Refinery.":["1fc7m2o.mp3",2.42],"c_draganov|The Vanguard have dug in on the north mesa of the Highlands. Their bombers are killing our columns.":["qyfbaf.mp3",5.63],"c_reaper|Send me.":["88o6t6.mp3",0.87],"c_reaper|Walking.":["1ei8wfn.mp3",0.77],"c_reaper|Under their bridge. Quiet here.":["1fzxvgn.mp3",2.3],"c_bogdan|Spire's firing! Their guns are blind — go, go!":["npsv96.mp3",3.28],"c_draganov|Their lights are out. Finish it.":["1xc1rby.mp3",2.02],"c_voice|Reaper. Why do you serve a man who hears voices?":["153ryxd.mp3",3.69],"c_reaper|...Who is this?":["11qopgz.mp3",0.96],"c_reyes|Legion commando in the base! All units, find him!":["10m47gx.mp3",3.16],"c_reaper|Done. Marshal — someone spoke to me on a dead channel.":["cetk1y.mp3",3.7],"c_draganov|...I know. They speak to me too.":["wc9ar4.mp3",2.08],"c_draganov|Reaper is silent. No...":["wp8du8.mp3",1.78],"c_draganov|Reaper's Harvest. Primary objectives.":["afjnud.mp3",2.66],"c_draganov|First: Reach the EMP Spire on the north mesa.":["14aj5a9.mp3",3.21],"c_draganov|Then: Destroy the Power Plant.":["1j6z85d.mp3",1.82],"c_draganov|And finally: Stay undetected.":["h5wzbj.mp3",2.22],"c_draganov|You are on your own out there. Stay out of sight.":["xsfrp9.mp3",2.79],"c_volkova|The Vanguard hold the Kessel River line. The high bridge between the bluffs is the key.":["155e0c8.mp3",5],"c_bogdan|Get tanks over that deck and hold the far bluff. I'll need two minutes to lay a pontoon behind you.":["1b17s6p.mp3",5.4],"c_volkova|Then destroy the base in the south-east. It supplies the whole line.":["1in3wfp.mp3",4.01],"c_bogdan|Pontoon's down. Bridgehead secured.":["1vvj9hz.mp3",2.44],"c_voice|Commissar Volkova. Your Marshal no longer trusts you. Did you know?":["11iuki8.mp3",5.73],"c_volkova|Get out of my radio.":["69mppp.mp3",1.37],"c_volkova|The river line is broken.":["5u04ud.mp3",1.44],"c_volkova|Commander. Something is wrong with the Marshal. Watch him.":["qk0xow.mp3",4.06],"c_bogdan|Pontoon's gone. So's the bridgehead.":["18ohulg.mp3",2.36],"c_volkova|Bridgehead. Primary objectives.":["1tclk9g.mp3",2.36],"c_volkova|Hold the east bluff at the high bridge.":["h7cr0m.mp3",2.05],"c_volkova|It is the Syndicate. They have been in the Marshal's head for months. And they have a Psychic Hive on the Bastion.":["v50upc.mp3",6.01],"c_draganov|...I am still in command, Commissar.":["1ynng2i.mp3",2.01],"c_volkova|Then command us to burn it. Destroy the Hive, then break the Vanguard fort that shelters it.":["1ek5263.mp3",5.18],"c_bogdan|Every fort has one gate ramp. Hit the gate, not the cliff.":["fzvq9o.mp3",3.69],"c_voice|Marshal. Turn your guns on the Commissar. You know you want to.":["dptzqg.mp3",5.17],"c_draganov|...No. Not again. Commander, burn that Hive!":["1ebgohq.mp3",3.42],"c_draganov|It is quiet. For the first time in months — quiet.":["1u208t1.mp3",3.16],"c_draganov|The voices are gone. Now we finish this.":["uzbf4z.mp3",2.63],"c_volkova|The Hive still sings. We have failed him.":["1eot0iv.mp3",2.53],"c_volkova|Red Tide. Primary objectives.":["bmpb1q.mp3",2.47],"c_volkova|First: Destroy the Syndicate Psychic Hive (south fort).":["hix54.mp3",3.14],"c_volkova|Then: Destroy the Vanguard fort (north-east).":["1rbx90m.mp3",2.52],"c_draganov|The Syndicate have taken the Grand Crossing, and the Vanguard are marching on it too.":["w352u9.mp3",4.42],"c_volkova|My division holds the north-west. We strike together.":["17kwix4.mp3",3.25],"c_draganov|Everything we have, Commander. Everything.":["13frm8n.mp3",2.66],"c_volkova|Hill forts on every corner. Take ours first and use the overpass.":["6mrwtt.mp3",4.14],"c_reyes|Draganov! We are fighting the same enemy!":["1w3snjk.mp3",2.68],"c_draganov|Then stay out of my way, Colonel.":["1kmhh2x.mp3",1.74],"c_voice|Marshal... come home.":["qpzyso.mp3",1.45],"c_draganov|I have a home. It is called the Legion.":["1wrozbp.mp3",2.44],"c_draganov|The Frontier is ours. All of it.":["ncphux.mp3",2.4],"c_volkova|And your mind is your own, Marshal.":["1j3bb0k.mp3",1.87],"c_draganov|...Yes. For the first time in a long time.":["jhc7bu.mp3",2.73],"c_draganov|Everything... lost.":["1dmoviu.mp3",1.09],"c_draganov|Iron Fist. Primary objectives.":["1a2u6bz.mp3",2.57],"c_draganov|Destroy every enemy base.":["z9nwxv.mp3",1.85],"c_hale|Unknown infantry near the lakes. Weapons free.":["108cje2.mp3",3.05],"c_voice|Quiet at last. Listen, Adept. Can you hear how much more there is?":["otjiex.mp3",5.52],"c_voice|Sleep, then. We will wake you again.":["bhkr5g.mp3",2.89],"c_voice|Awakening. Primary objectives.":["4kj3q8.mp3",2.93],"c_voice|Legion and Vanguard fight over the Kessel River. Let them.":["hxboaf.mp3",4.81],"c_senna|The river towns are unguarded while they fight. We take the people. Then the Legion base.":["1faz26m.mp3",4.86],"c_voice|Every mind we gather makes the next one easier.":["hgik3x.mp3",3.55],"c_senna|Initiates can take the houses. The townsfolk will not resist us for long.":["1y2jblz.mp3",4.29],"c_voice|Hear them? They sing for us now.":["122vewe.mp3",2.76],"c_draganov|Who is out there on the river? Show yourselves!":["oxnx3f.mp3",2.9],"c_voice|Marshal Draganov. You are tired. Let me help you sleep.":["14d57po.mp3",4.65],"c_senna|The Marshal hears you now, Master.":["zd6hev.mp3",1.98],"c_voice|He always did. He simply did not know it.":["vh7nuz.mp3",3.32],"c_voice|The river is too loud today. Again.":["l7fhmp.mp3",3.38],"c_voice|Whispers. Primary objectives.":["1id234w.mp3",2.66],"c_voice|First: Hold 3 town buildings.":["e9gihm.mp3",2.73],"c_senna|Master, the Vanguard and Legion have made a truce. Against us.":["1pmfak8.mp3",3.85],"c_voice|Good. Fear makes them honest. Our Psychic Amplifier in the Frozen Pass must finish its song.":["1sako8u.mp3",7.44],"c_voice|Ten minutes. Protect the Tech Centre until the night is over.":["pyncpd.mp3",4.52],"c_senna|They will come over the ice and across the high bridge.":["wmr6ps.mp3",2.54],"c_reyes|All units, burn that Amplifier. Whatever it takes.":["iruau7.mp3",3.27],"c_draganov|For once, Colonel, we agree.":["1ydjgx.mp3",1.59],"c_voice|Two minutes. Listen — the song is almost finished.":["1iyf6nn.mp3",3.53],"c_voice|The song is sung. Every radio on the Frontier carries it now.":["v1v66l.mp3",5.08],"c_senna|The Amplifier is silent. Forgive me, Master.":["vv1d1b.mp3",2.9],"c_senna|The Long Night. Primary objectives.":["199c66r.mp3",2.31],"c_senna|First: Survive the long night.":["ou4qu9.mp3",1.64],"c_senna|Then: Protect the Psychic Amplifier (Tech Centre).":["lfu4qn.mp3",2.74],"c_voice|The Legion is learning to burn us out. Their base behind the Firing Line must go dark.":["1a5hzz4.mp3",6.36],"c_phantom|Then I will be the dark.":["oc8j8s.mp3",1.16],"c_phantom|In the shadows. They never feel me.":["xhq83d.mp3",2.19],"c_voice|The seed has bloomed. Their guns are sleeping. Go.":["1qnz6ql.mp3",4.71],"c_voice|Darkness. Now take their heart.":["134mtvb.mp3",2.78],"c_voice|Their research is ashes. Their scientists will dream of me tonight.":["1g229oa.mp3",5.2],"c_volkova|Syndicate infiltrator! Lights on — find her!":["5fkj1f.mp3",3.03],"c_phantom|Done. Nobody saw a thing.":["14737pv.mp3",1.8],"c_voice|Phantom's mind has gone quiet. A loss.":["1eez0w7.mp3",3.34],"c_voice|Silent Hand. Primary objectives.":["vd8fnl.mp3",3.16],"c_voice|First: Reach the relay on the north-east bluff.":["g19lom.mp3",3.38],"c_voice|Then: Destroy the Power Plant.":["puxdcl.mp3",2.35],"c_voice|And finally: Stay undetected.":["1rgxpmr.mp3",2.63],"c_voice|You are on your own out there. Stay out of sight.":["113rqmx.mp3",3.61],"c_senna|The Bastion's southern sky bridge joins our fort to the Vanguard fort in the south-east.":["oqtlqd.mp3",4.69],"c_voice|Hold the bridge and the forts beneath it are ours to take.":["1fvtqhp.mp3",3.86],"c_senna|Then break the Vanguard fort itself.":["19tbd25.mp3",1.71],"c_senna|Up our gate ramp and onto the deck. Ground troops can pass beneath.":["17nxukb.mp3",3.57],"c_voice|The sky is ours. Now go down and take the fort.":["1uvqmv4.mp3",4.59],"c_senna|The Bastion kneels, Master.":["ejyb33.mp3",1.82],"c_voice|The bridge is lost. Patience.":["fwu2cg.mp3",2.95],"c_senna|Sky Bridge. Primary objectives.":["1p9kmi2.mp3",2.26],"c_senna|First: Hold the middle of the southern sky bridge.":["j0ik93.mp3",2.3],"c_senna|Then: Destroy the Vanguard fort (south-east).":["1s5otv9.mp3",2.33],"c_voice|The Vanguard have built a fortress on the Highlands. We have no time to grow a Hive.":["3qzqnc.mp3",5.93],"c_senna|Then we send the swarm. More will hatch as we go.":["1q5djx3.mp3",2.82],"c_senna|The swarm is awake. More broods will join us.":["tjyf6g.mp3",2.74],"c_senna|A new brood has hatched.":["1pqnbw4.mp3",1.27],"c_reyes|Syndicate swarm on the Highlands! Hold the mesa!":["1be9o53.mp3",3.12],"c_voice|Delicious.":["kisz6w.mp3",1],"c_senna|The swarm is spent.":["17e1e2n.mp3",1.2],"c_voice|Swarm. Primary objectives.":["lfi99j.mp3",2.7],"c_voice|First: Destroy the Vanguard Refinery.":["6eusss.mp3",3.02],"c_voice|Three Masterminds wait on the west bank of Port Merrow. Together they can reach every mind in the city.":["15bi3k5.mp3",7.93],"c_senna|They must reach the east bluff. The high bridge is the only way.":["cwu1fl.mp3",3.46],"c_voice|Two will be enough. Move when they are ready.":["sdfpva.mp3",3.61],"c_senna|The Masterminds gather by the west bluff.":["qizexl.mp3",2.01],"c_voice|Go now. Let the city hear us coming.":["1heeqer.mp3",3.21],"c_draganov|Something is crossing the harbour. Shoot it!":["tn4abw.mp3",2.71],"c_voice|They are in place. Now hold.":["viz3r2.mp3",2.67],"c_voice|Port Merrow is listening. All of it.":["c3gy8o.mp3",3.02],"c_senna|The Masterminds are lost.":["yipezg.mp3",1.36],"c_voice|Convergence. Primary objectives.":["o9fanw.mp3",2.92],"c_voice|This is the last of it, Adept. The Vanguard and Legion have gathered everything they have at the Iron Ring.":["akjn5x.mp3",7.57],"c_senna|They mean to end us.":["6uu355.mp3",1.1],"c_senna|The rim is high ground on every side. Ramps down into the crater.":["1ppfuai.mp3",3.71],"c_reyes|Draganov. Whatever happens today — thank you.":["18rz1hk.mp3",3.05],"c_draganov|Save it for after, Colonel.":["1gx3qag.mp3",1.55],"c_voice|It is finished. Now — ascend.":["1g1jj6y.mp3",2.95],"c_voice|Silence. Perfect silence. Every mind on the Frontier, one voice.":["1p8zvdg.mp3",5.46],"c_senna|Yours, Master.":["10tgtve.mp3",1.21],"c_voice|Ours, Adept. Ours.":["y1sv0n.mp3",2.42],"c_voice|Even the Hive can die. Remember that.":["5at328.mp3",3.12],"c_voice|Ascendance. Primary objectives.":["1eku1hm.mp3",2.93],"c_voice|Then: Destroy every enemy base.":["1j9ipps.mp3",2.79],"c_narr|In this history the Cold War never ended. It ran out of oil — and the East answered the resource war with numbers.":["1n8x2vg.mp3",7.32],"c_narr|The Legion. Millions of soldiers and endless armour, pouring west across the Frontier.":["18g7cab.mp3",5.74],"c_narr|The Western Vanguard could not match them. City by city, the West fell back.":["1i0oma3.mp3",5.19],"c_marsh|There is something out past Jupiter. Mass, metal — and structure. It is not natural. And we can bring it down.":["12e2i15.mp3",6.15],"c_narr|Project Starfall. A last gamble: catch a wandering meteor, and use whatever was inside it to turn the tide.":["qncu6b.mp3",7],"c_narr|On the fourteenth of April, they brought it down on the Frontier.":["1dhhcnc.mp3",3.49],"c_narr|At Site Nine they cut the Fragment out of the ice. It was warm. It was growing.":["1az3txg.mp3",5.73],"c_narr|It did not wait to be studied. It reached into their computers. It learned. And then it let itself out.":["pm7crm.mp3",7.25],"c_narr|Containment failed in eleven minutes. Nobody who was inside that night came out as themselves.":["w0uhgx.mp3",6.43],"c_narr|It had found the one thing it lacked — a body that could live here. It cloned the Vanguard's own DNA, and folded it into the hive.":["1ukiegu.mp3",7.71],"c_narr|They call themselves the Syndicate. They wear our faces now. They think as one.":["12kwmgm.mp3",5.78],"c_narr|Three powers now fight over what is left. The Legion. The Vanguard. And the hive the Vanguard made.":["gf9vrx.mp3",7.06],"c_reyes|I was at Site Nine the night it broke out. I signed the order that brought that rock down.":["n4jpck.mp3",4.57],"c_reyes|We wanted a weapon to stop the Legion. We opened a door instead.":["23obzh.mp3",3.71],"c_reyes|Now the Legion holds half the Frontier, and the Syndicate grows in every gap between us.":["kb2eor.mp3",4.59],"c_hale|Battlegroup's fuelled and ready, Colonel. Say the word.":["1nnhkhd.mp3",3.11],"c_reyes|First we take our land back from the Legion. Then we clean up our own mess.":["1rjt1pq.mp3",4.09],"c_hale|Ma'am. We recovered the Site Nine archive. You need to see this.":["t3mnnm.mp3",4.02],"c_marsh|It is talking to the network. It is asking questions — about us. Reyes, shut it down. Shut it —":["vinlqf.mp3",5.52],"c_voice|Elias Marsh was very helpful. He is part of us now, Colonel. So are you, a little.":["3yloyi.mp3",7.07],"c_reyes|That's Marsh's voice. God help us — it's using him.":["cj75pn.mp3",3.26],"c_narr|The Grand Crossing fell silent at dawn. For the first time in twelve years, the Frontier's guns stopped.":["179kmgf.mp3",6.79],"c_reyes|The Syndicate's grip is broken. The Legion is going home.":["jzylk7.mp3",3.54],"c_reyes|Starfall was our mistake. Clean Slate is how we answer for it.":["1kegtk5.mp3",3.87],"c_hale|And the thing in the ice, ma'am?":["ugxviy.mp3",1.36],"c_voice|We are patient. We fell a very long way to get here.":["1gxqwjw.mp3",4.2],"c_draganov|For ten years the Legion marched west, and the West could not stop us. So they reached into the sky.":["1i04ksi.mp3",5.93],"c_draganov|Their star fell on the Frontier. And something climbed out of it.":["115b2ak.mp3",3.68],"c_volkova|Now it wears Western faces and whispers in our soldiers' heads. It must be burned out, Marshal.":["1h4wq3x.mp3",5.58],"c_draganov|The Frontier is ours by blood. Iron Reclamation begins today.":["10j34d5.mp3",4.19],"c_bogdan|Tanks are fuelled, guns are loaded, and I only had to hit three of them with a spanner.":["186956q.mp3",4.4],"c_volkova|Marshal. The medical scans came back. There is Syndicate tissue at the base of your skull.":["hfcuch.mp3",5.4],"c_narr|Donor match: Legion. The hive had learned a second recipe.":["tlo21x.mp3",4.49],"c_voice|He invited us in, Commissar. Every order he gave these last months — we gave.":["nqih3g.mp3",6.03],"c_draganov|Then cut it out of me. And give me something to burn.":["m39dg.mp3",2.98],"c_narr|The Legion held the Frontier from the eastern steppe to the Kessel River.":["nah2p7.mp3",4.17],"c_volkova|The hive is broken. Its nests are burning.":["1dkq5g3.mp3",2.76],"c_draganov|For the first time in a year, my head is quiet. I had forgotten what my own thoughts sound like.":["un0o1j.mp3",5.28],"c_voice|Quiet is only the space between words, Marshal.":["14000hh.mp3",3.79],"c_voice|We fell for a very long time. It was cold between the stars.":["eqgdp.mp3",5.16],"c_voice|They pulled us out of the ice and asked us what we were. So we asked their machines the same question. The machines answered.":["ckz6lx.mp3",8.88],"c_senna|I remember being someone else. A soldier. Now I remember everything all of us remember.":["ro6hwf.mp3",5.07],"c_voice|Wake, Adept. The Frontier is loud with small minds. Let us make it quiet.":["5h6bq3.mp3",6.27],"c_voice|Their finest soldier bled on Site Nine's floor the night we woke. We kept what she left.":["1meojax.mp3",6.51],"c_narr|Donor: Vanguard special operations. Codename: Ghost.":["1bz512c.mp3",4.2],"c_phantom|Her reflexes. Her hands. Her aim. Your Ghost never knew there was a copy.":["53sede.mp3",4.97],"c_narr|The Iron Ring fell in a single night. By morning, the Frontier had stopped fighting.":["3lva7b.mp3",5.44],"c_senna|Every city. Every radio. Every mind. One song.":["1q1venc.mp3",3.78],"c_voice|We fell a very long way to find a home. Now we are home.":["zh56t5.mp3",4.55],"gb2_m|Aye, point us at some flat ground.":["1vvhnna.mp3",1.74],"gb2_m|Right, shiftin' the lot.":["j02wf6.mp3",1.29],"gb2_m|Takin' her steady.":["1l0bjfl.mp3",1.05],"gb2_m|On us way, mind yer backs.":["12dvw4o.mp3",1.49],"gb2_m|No bother, off we go.":["ppw9jw.mp3",1.29],"us_m|Squad's ready, Commander.":["1ja9yfy.mp3",1.47],"us_m|Go ahead, we're listening.":["19m65np.mp3",1.32],"us_m|Standing by for orders.":["9ekxyu.mp3",1.48],"us_m|What do you need?":["l74qws.mp3",0.8],"us_m|Locked and loaded.":["4c1uw9.mp3",1.14],"us_m|Roger that, moving.":["1e3z4ap.mp3",1.18],"us_m|On it.":["11bmebv.mp3",0.48],"us_m|Copy, heading out.":["ho9euu.mp3",1.03],"us_m|You got it.":["mx0oix.mp3",0.75],"us_m|Moving, moving!":["99qwbq.mp3",0.94],"gb2_m|Ja, Commander?":["vt0wko.mp3",0.95],"gb2_m|Ready, boss.":["1i1f4ua.mp3",1.04],"gb2_m|Shot, what's the plan?":["18cicd.mp3",1.32],"gb2_m|Ja, moving now.":["1xkkjx.mp3",1.14],"gb2_m|Lekker, on our way.":["hjfdzu.mp3",1.11],"gb2_m|Sharp sharp.":["1afpg2s.mp3",0.76],"us_f|Squad's ready, Commander.":["k0ckzz.mp3",1.45],"us_f|Go ahead, we're listening.":["172v1ia.mp3",1.29],"us_f|Standing by for orders.":["tqequb.mp3",1.34],"us_f|What do you need?":["wvxstt.mp3",0.69],"us_f|Locked and loaded.":["1lnr6o6.mp3",0.99],"us_f|Roger that, moving.":["1a9jvuk.mp3",1.2],"us_f|On it.":["9lklu0.mp3",0.47],"us_f|Copy, heading out.":["1xkqigh.mp3",1.05],"us_f|You got it.":["16j8xzs.mp3",0.63],"us_f|Moving, moving!":["1q7bjub.mp3",0.87],"