abandoned when the Legion swept through twelve years ago.":["1fhhxu.mp3",8.39],"c_hale|Half of it is rubble, ma'am. But the Training Hall, a Solar Array and an Ore Processor are still standing. There's no Command Spire, so we can't build anything new.":["1t74895.mp3",9.14],"c_reyes|Then we use what is there. Send your Technicians to capture the old buildings, get the Training Hall producing Riflemen, and push the Legion scouts out of this valley.":["1yd13vz.mp3",8.49],"c_hale|Technicians carry the tool kits. Select one, then tap a building to capture it. A Technician sent into your own building repairs it.":["tewq5b.mp3",7.82],"c_reyes|The Training Hall is ours. Select it and train Riflemen. Credits are tight, so spend them well.":["s2z152.mp3",6.07],"c_hale|Lights are back on. The Training Hall runs at full speed now.":["1kz5v2l.mp3",3.66],"c_hale|The old harvester still turns over! Ore is flowing again.":["53znui.mp3",3.51],"c_reyes|That is a fighting force. The Legion scouts are dug in to the south-east. Clear them out.":["krtt5f.mp3",5.33],"c_hale|Legion scouts coming up the road!":["w0zyjk.mp3",1.97],"c_draganov|Vanguard, digging through old ruins? How fitting. Go home.":["pm73w0.mp3",3.98],"c_reyes|Good work, Commander. We have a foothold. Next time we come with a Command Spire.":["y3erxs.mp3",4.92],"c_reyes|We lost the outpost. Regroup and try again.":["mr990i.mp3",2.99],"c_reyes|Old Ground. Primary objectives.":["2l9oaz.mp3",2.43],"c_reyes|First: Capture the old Training Hall with a Technician.":["dioch9.mp3",2.8],"c_reyes|Then: Capture the Solar Array to restore power.":["q00baj.mp3",2.54],"c_hale|Good news, Commander. Engineering has a Command Spire for you. Solar Arrays, Ore Processors, a Training Hall and Auto Turrets. No armour yet.":["170gnof.mp3",9.08],"c_reyes|The Assembly Bay plans have been cleared. You can field Warden tanks and Skirmishers now.":["14pyt5s.mp3",4.86],"c_reyes|And the Paladin walker program is live. With a Research Spire you get air power, elite troops and Paladins.":["1lxbsh0.mp3",6.16],"c_hale|The first Paladin walker just came off the line. She's yours, Commander.":["1fr6w3n.mp3",4.34],"c_hale|Naval yard plans came through too, ma'am. Full arsenal, bar one.":["jg3j2v.mp3",4.07],"c_reyes|High Command has authorised the Photon Lance. If you can build it, use it.":["1lkp3l9.mp3",4.51],"c_draganov|Comrade Commander. When we pulled back from the Frozen Pass, we left a depot behind. The Vanguard never found it.":["1bpw44l.mp3",7.11],"c_bogdan|Half the roof is gone and the snow got into everything, but the Muster Bunker, a Thermal Plant and the Smelting Works are still standing. No Fortress HQ, so you build nothing new.":["yqmure.mp3",10.73],"c_volkova|Your Technicians will take the depot back. Train Militia, then drive the Vanguard patrols out of the pass.":["jmg5jz.mp3",5.74],"c_bogdan|Technicians are the lads with the tool bags. Pick one, point him at a building, and it's ours. Send one into our own building and he'll patch it up.":["bmjxdt.mp3",7.89],"c_volkova|The bunker is ours. Train Militia. Every ruble counts, Commander.":["8opoxu.mp3",4.34],"c_bogdan|Power's back. Kicked the generator twice, but she's running.":["gttavf.mp3",3.38],"c_bogdan|Found an old ore hauler under the snow. Still runs!":["y62fnq.mp3",3.18],"c_volkova|Enough. The Vanguard patrol base is to the north-east. Crush it.":["1o3jljo.mp3",5.22],"c_reyes|Legion movement in the pass. Push them back.":["ybyndu.mp3",2.93],"c_draganov|The pass is ours again. Now we build properly.":["1gg4yup.mp3",3.35],"c_volkova|The depot is lost. Unacceptable.":["6lw0kx.mp3",2.57],"c_draganov|First: Capture the old Muster Bunker with a Technician.":["p52y9.mp3",3.24],"c_draganov|Then: Capture the Thermal Plant to restore power.":["kxo9jn.mp3",2.91],"c_bogdan|I got an old Fortress HQ running. Thermal Plants, Smelting Works, a Muster Bunker and Gun Bunkers. Tanks come later.":["1g76qp9.mp3",7.8],"c_bogdan|The Foundry is back on line. Mauler tanks and Ravagers are yours.":["1pbc02j.mp3",4.23],"c_draganov|And the Juggernaut is ready, Commander. Build a War Institute and it will walk for you, along with our aircraft.":["b8tnz6.mp3",6.23],"c_bogdan|Deck's rated for Maulers. I checked. Twice.":["1m13ltp.mp3",3.1],"c_bogdan|The Juggernaut is on the field, Commander. Try to bring it back in one piece.":["6cexd2.mp3",4.27],"c_bogdan|I've bolted on extra armour, a couple of Bombards, and you get the Juggernaut. Don't scratch it.":["1otr14y.mp3",5.32],"c_draganov|The Missile Silo is yours to build. Use it.":["pmfark.mp3",3.01],"c_voice|Wake, Adept. A year free of their cage, and we have so little. But there is a Vanguard outpost by the lakes. Its builders fled long ago.":["1757q0d.mp3",10.39],"c_senna|I feel it, Master. A barracks, a power plant, a refinery. Broken, but alive. We cannot grow a Hive Core here yet.":["1qwys33.mp3",7.31],"c_voice|Then take what they left. Our Technicians will claim it. Raise Acolytes, and silence the Vanguard camp across the water.":["151ws7j.mp3",8.59],"c_senna|Our Technicians can bend their machines to us. Choose one, then touch a building to claim it.":["1lsjgl.mp3",4.38],"c_voice|It is ours. Raise Acolytes from it. We must be frugal for now.":["10fyqwi.mp3",5.15],"c_senna|The current flows again. I can feel it humming.":["ftoy5g.mp3",2.62],"c_senna|Their old harvester answers to us now.":["1p82f6l.mp3",2.23],"c_voice|Enough. The Vanguard camp lies across the lakes to the south-east. Quiet it.":["cb0jyo.mp3",5.88],"c_voice|First: Claim the old barracks with a Technician.":["yq3fkp.mp3",3.15],"c_voice|Then: Claim the power plant.":["xhjb9r.mp3",2.08],"c_senna|Our Hive Core can grow now, Master. Bio Reactors, Digesters, a Spawning Pit and Spitter Nests.":["ym7y3n.mp3",5.77],"c_voice|The Fabricator is open to you. Fang Tanks and Stingers answer your call.":["1ptggwn.mp3",6.04],"c_voice|The Devourer has matured. Grow a Gene Vault and it will hunt for you, with our fliers.":["177dke7.mp3",6.23],"c_senna|The first Devourer has hatched. It hungers.":["w1pgyh.mp3",2.63],"c_voice|And the Psychic Amplifier seed is yours. When it has grown, the city will kneel.":["1l1i56x.mp3",5.82],"c_voice|First: Grow the Psychic Amplifier (superweapon).":["bw44yl.mp3",3.63],"c_hale|Riflemen for their infantry, Lancers for anything with armour or wings. Technicians don't fight — keep them back until they have a building to take.":["1kl1oqr.mp3",8.44],"c_hale|Their Foundry in the north-east is feeding tanks straight onto that bridge. Take the bluff, then take the factory.":["b0jrgy.mp3",6.36],"c_reyes|Then: Destroy the Legion Factory.":["1lq7rg1.mp3",2.16],"c_reyes|First: Capture the EMP tower on the north mesa (Technician).":["4win19.mp3",3.33],"c_reyes|Then: Destroy both Legion headquarters.":["9c17d8.mp3",2.34],"c_reyes|You go in alone and unseen. Reach our relay on the north bluff and Hale will EMP their defences. Blow the Power Plant, then the Fortress HQ. Get inside a building and press B to set a charge.":["1rwx0y.mp3",11.51],"c_reyes|Power is down. Their defences are dead for good. Now the Headquarters.":["nk2e83.mp3",4.48],"c_reyes|Destroy the Legion Fortress HQ.":["g17iwj.mp3",2.29],"c_bogdan|Militia for their riflemen, Bombardiers for tanks and aircraft. The Technicians carry tools, not rifles — keep them out of the shooting.":["1w518b.mp3",7.77],"c_draganov|Then: Destroy the Vanguard Headquarters.":["4jpe2u.mp3",2.26],"c_draganov|Alone and unseen, Reaper. Reach the EMP Spire on the mesa — Bogdan has rigged it to blind their guns. Then the Power Plant, then the Headquarters. Set charges from inside with B.":["4kefaq.mp3",11.57],"c_volkova|Destroy their Refinery and Factory. Leave nothing they can use.":["rew17n.mp3",4.05],"c_volkova|Then: Destroy the Vanguard Factory.":["i44bhr.mp3",2.15],"c_senna|Acolytes for their soldiers, Piercers for their machines and their aircraft. The Technicians are for claiming, not for fighting.":["3v9l82.mp3",6.34],"c_voice|Then: Destroy the Legion Fortress HQ.":["zrrhsm.mp3",3.27],"c_voice|A seeded mind in their grid will pulse when you reach the north-east relay. Their Power Plant first, then their headquarters. Unseen, Phantom. Charges from inside with B.":["8ed89h.mp3",13.36],"c_voice|Their Refinery and Factory. Devour them.":["zrm6lj.mp3",3.76],"c_voice|Then: Destroy the Vanguard Factory.":["43oiaz.mp3",2.75],"c_voice|Bring at least 2 Overminds to the east bluff.":["1schtps.mp3",2.97],"c_voice|Build the Overmind. Then show them what the end looks like.":["oivd11.mp3",4.44],"gb_f|Headquarters deployed.":["gdm2oc.mp3",1.29],"ru_f|Headquarters deployed.":["1j3v0og.mp3",1.4],"gb2_m|Prospector ready.":["zwkjm2.mp3",1.05],"gb2_m|Hopper's empty. Where's the ore?":["1ryfgzy.mp3",1.87],"gb2_m|Collector standing by.":["w414g6.mp3",1.43],"gb2_m|Heading out.":["9qvx5a.mp3",0.67],"gb2_m|Going for the ore.":["ggtcn6.mp3",0.95],"gb2_m|On the move.":["isblfx.mp3",0.76],"gb2_m|Technician here.":["ax9uoc.mp3",0.93],"gb2_m|Tools ready, Commander.":["1v81o3q.mp3",1.31],"gb2_m|Point me at it and I'll sort it.":["1bq8kk.mp3",1.31],"gb2_m|On my way.":["o7ymxu.mp3",0.87],"gb2_m|Heading over with the kit.":["1r7lbod.mp3",1.25],"gb2_m|Moving.":["jc6fvq.mp3",0.54],"us_m|Crew ready.":["gkh1q1.mp3",0.77],"us_f|Crew ready.":["1612eek.mp3",0.69],"us_f|On station, Commander.":["b9c3ep.mp3",1.43],"us_m|On station, Commander.":["fnoduq.mp3",1.4],"gb2_m|Runnin' quiet, mate.":["1diunp2.mp3",1.23],"gb2_f|Ready to sail, mate.":["1iqvq1r.mp3",1.28],"gb2_f|No worries, underway.":["10is1os.mp3",1.32],"gb2_m|Construction crew standing by.":["10iys2t.mp3",1.83],"gb2_m|Ready to deploy.":["fw9qjl.mp3",1.03],"gb2_m|Logistics, go ahead.":["ae45a4.mp3",1.32],"gb2_m|Relocating.":["1co9yp4.mp3",0.88],"gb2_m|Moving the convoy.":["9qeqnr.mp3",1.11],"gb2_m|En route.":["19z0kqu.mp3",0.66],"gb_f|Unit under attack.":["14czgip.mp3",1.23],"gb_f|Our harvester is under attack.":["1gunpxf.mp3",1.76],"ru_m|Hauler ready.":["oz8uwc.mp3",0.87],"ru_